#: keyconfig.cpp:76
msgid "Current scheme"
msgstr "Huidige skema"

#: keyconfig.cpp:78
msgid "KDE default"
msgstr "KDE verstek"

#: keyconfig.cpp:85
msgid "&Key scheme"
msgstr "Sleutels&kema"

#: keyconfig.cpp:87
msgid ""
"Here you can see a list of the existing key binding schemes with 'Current "
"scheme' referring to the settings you are using right now. Select a scheme "
"to use it, remove or change it."
msgstr ""

#: keyconfig.cpp:93
msgid "&Add ..."
msgstr "Voeg b&y ..."

#: keyconfig.cpp:95
msgid ""
"Click here to add a new key bindings scheme. You will be prompted for a name."
msgstr ""

#: keyconfig.cpp:100
msgid ""
"Click here to remove the selected key bindings scheme. You can not remove "
"the standard system wide schemes, 'Current scheme' and 'KDE default'."
msgstr ""

#: keyconfig.cpp:103
msgid "&Save changes"
msgstr "&Stoor veranderinge"

#: keyconfig.cpp:106
msgid ""
"Click here to save your changes to the selected key bindings scheme. You can "
"not save changes to the standard system wide schemes, 'Current scheme' and "
"'KDE default'."
msgstr ""

#: keyconfig.cpp:184
msgid ""
"This key scheme could not be removed.\n"
"Perhaps you do not have permission to alter the file\n"
"system where the key scheme is stored."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie sleutelskema kon nie verwyder word nie.\n"
"Dalk het u nie regte om die lêerstelse te verander\n"
"waar die sleutelskema gestoor word nie."

#: keyconfig.cpp:311
msgid ""
"Please choose a unique name for the new key\n"
"scheme. The one you entered already appears\n"
"in the key scheme list."
msgstr ""
"Kies asb. 'n unieke naam vir die nuwe sleutelskema.\n"
"Die een wat u ingetik het bestaan alreeds in die\n"
"skemalys."

#: savescm.cpp:19
msgid "Add a key scheme"
msgstr "Voeg 'n sleutelskema by"

#: savescm.cpp:33
msgid ""
"&Enter a name for the new key scheme\n"
"to be added to your personal list.\n"
"\n"
"The keys currently used in the preview will\n"
"be copied into this scheme to begin with."
msgstr ""
"Tik 'n nuwe naam vir di&e sleutelskema om by\n"
"u persoonlike lys gevoweg te word.\n"
"\n"
"Die sleutels wat huidig indie voorskou gebruik\n"
"word sal na hierdie skema gekopieër word."

#: main.cpp:41
msgid "&Global shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:45
msgid "&Application shortcuts"
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<h1>Key Bindings</h1> Using key bindings you can configure certain actions "
"to be triggered when you press a key or a combination of keys, e.g. CTRL-C "
"is normally bound to 'Copy'. KDE allows you to store more than one 'scheme' "
"of key bindings, so you might want to experiment a little setting up your "
"own scheme while you can still change back to the KDE defaults.<p> In the "
"tab 'Global shortcuts' you can configure non-application specific bindings "
"like how to switch desktops or maximize a window. In the tab 'Application "
"shortcuts' you'll find bindings typically used in applications, such as copy "
"and paste."
msgstr ""
